{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/34084-what-can-people-come-up-with-for-god-machine-story-seeds-from-real-world-events","id":34084,"title":"What can people come up with for God-Machine story seeds from Real World events","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-20T14:35:46-08:00","id":34084,"title":"What can people come up with for God-Machine story seeds from Real World events","content":"So I was thinking that people could post news stories, local legends, etc. that might serve well as inspiration for God-Machine stories. Let's post a link to it, and some questions to serve as spring-boards for those who get the itch to write. I'll start it off!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://gizmodo.com/something-called-the-object-has-stopped-worlds-large-1487090414\" target=\"_blank\">Something Called &quot;The Object&quot; Stops World's Largest Tunneling Machine</a><br /> <br /> Is Big Bertha's purpose for laying down massive Infrastructure? Is &quot;The Object&quot; old Infrastructure set aside for eventual re-use? Is &quot;The Object&quot; the product of Saboteurs looking to disrupt the G-M's plans? Is this the G-M's way of bringing &quot;The Object&quot; out of cold storage?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-20T15:31:07-08:00","id":34123,"title":"","content":"Nice to start with something in the signature city.<br /> <br /> To go along with it:<br /> <br /> The Alaska Way Viaduct is Infrastructure, old and crumbling Infrastructure. What was it's purpose? And why is in such bad shape? Did the God-Machine abandon it or did Demon's destory/subvert it? Is the new tunnel Infrastructure as well? If so, why is the God-Machine suddenly having it built now?<br /> <br /> No further link really, but the &quot;The Object&quot; link above would be relevant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-20T15:35:13-08:00","id":34131,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ley_line\" target=\"_blank\">Ley lines</a>, geometrical alignments of places of cultural importance. Infrastructure sure sounds a lot more geometrical than magic to me.<br /> <br /> P.S. ElvesofZion, love the username.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-20T15:49:45-08:00","id":34142,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://m.motherjones.com/environment/2013/08/sinkhole-swallowed-11-barges\" target=\"_blank\">http://m.motherjones.com/environment...owed-11-barges</a> What happens when a plot against the Machine backfires? Demons, mages, and shapeshifters in the area of this Lake know. The Infrastructure was simple, and placed in a lake that was ten feet deep. But the Inquisitors uncovered information that a new well was going to disturb what their allies called a &quot;powerful spirit&quot;. The demons kept this information from God, eliminating any witnesses and ensuring the infrastructure was finished. The resulting disaster was horrific. The lake, and rig, collapsed into a massive sinkhole. The area around it changed forever.. it shifted, became vile and corrupt. Shapeshifters who witnessed the disaster refer to an entity they call Magath. They say the sinkhole wounded the spirit world, and that other wounds, and other sinkholes, are opening up to swallow everything around them. worse? the disaster was such a profound loss of resources for the Machine that it effectively removed itself from the area. Angels are not arriving to deal with the problem, and no infrastructure is being built to contain the growing spiritual taint. This problem has to be fixed by someone, and the other monsters have begun to suspect that the cataclysm was not an accident.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-20T16:00:44-08:00","id":34152,"title":"","content":"It does not have to be environmental. Perhaps some county in some state had so many tosses and turns in their counting of a national election that the decision was up in the air for weeks on end. Could this have been due to the machinations of some Demons and Angels going back and forth until one side finally won?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-21T22:59:53-08:00","id":34813,"title":"","content":"There's a reason they do the ball drop every New Year in New York City. The ball is Infrastructure, and the resonance of optimism, excitement, and delirious joy that the crowd gives off &quot;flavors&quot; the essence perfectly for the Infrastructure to do its job. But what is that job, and why does the God-Machine consider it important enough to have no fewer than fifty angels at key points in and around Times Square during the New Year's Eve celebration?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T20:53:19-08:00","id":36069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.redmondderbydays.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://www.redmondderbydays.com/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=746\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.redmondderbydays.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> Derby Days | Redmond, WA </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.redmondderbydays.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.redmondderbydays.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> derby,days,parade,criterium,dash,5K,race,contest,festival,event,carnival,music,entertainment,beer garden,stage </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The Derby Days in redmond is a yearly occult matrix where the God Machine's agents use the populace of their command center: Redmond to generate a large amount of energy to power the Machine's yearly infrastructure. So many humans participate in the infrastructure that no one notice a small collection of them go missing during the races. Demon's of the Seattle Metro area know to be crazy careful when in Redmond but many are unwilling to enter the city during this event when the Machine is at its most active... and its most watchful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T21:48:38-08:00","id":36110,"title":"","content":"Most stories of Mothman are centered around Point Pleasant; after the Silver Bridge collapsed, killing 46, sightings of the Mothman dropped significantly. <br /> <br /> We now &quot;know&quot; Mothmen to be Cryptids - animals corrupted by interaction with Infrastructure - so the story neatly writes itself; the Silver Bridge was Infrastructure, it created a number of Mothmen by accidental exposure, and when the bridge was demolished by an Angel following whatever its purpose was, the Mothmen left the area in search of new Aether resources.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T17:51:39-08:00","id":36649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://shine.yahoo.com/parenting/emergency-c-section-turns-no-baby-150400404.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://shine.yahoo.com/parenting/emergency-c-section-turns-no-baby-150400404.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://shine.yahoo.com/parenting/emergency-c-section-turns-no-baby-150400404.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://shine.yahoo.com/parenting/emergency-c-section-turns-no-baby-150400404.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kismet's <a href=\"http://www.wod.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">WOD</a> - <a href=\"http://www.dnd.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">D&amp;D</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BoundinDreams\" target=\"_blank\">C:tL</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheNamelessEmpire\" target=\"_blank\">M:tC</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/227-kismetrose","name":"KismetRose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T20:56:56-08:00","id":36732,"title":"","content":"I was in Sydney during <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2009_Australian_dust_storm\" target=\"_blank\">2009 dust storm</a>, and one of most eeriest things of my life, a quarter of a continent and a major city blanketed in a strange orange dust.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1072,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1072-theye1","user":"theye1","date":". 12-24-2013, 11:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1072-theye1","name":"theye1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1072_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T07:06:12-08:00","id":37310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>theye1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/34084-what-can-people-come-up-with-for-god-machine-story-seeds-from-real-world-events?p=36732#post36732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was in Sydney during <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2009_Australian_dust_storm\" target=\"_blank\">2009 dust storm</a>, and one of most eeriest things of my life, a quarter of a continent and a major city blanketed in a strange orange dust.</div> </div> </div> </div> Whoa. That reminds me of living in Phoenix, except the storms would last hours, not days. Hours are creepy enough, but man...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T06:05:43-08:00","id":37814,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://distractify.com/culture/arts/the-most-spectacular-abandoned-places-in-the-world/\" target=\"_blank\">Here are some of the abandoned places, ghost towns, and deserted institutions around the globe.</a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-28T16:11:28-08:00","id":38477,"title":"","content":"Number stations.<br /> <br /> Generally believed to be run by various international intelligence agencies, these shortwave broadcasts put out strange messages - one from New Mexico samples an old Looney Toons episode, while another in Russia gives strings of numbers after a reciting a number of Russian names - and have been thought to exist since World War 1. The leading theory is that number stations are used to contact spies operating in foreign nations in a format that is nearly impossible to crack. One of the most famous - UVB-76, known by some as The Buzzer - has buzzed continuously since the 70s, only rarely broken by numbers recitations or whispered conversations.<br /> <br /> These cryptic devices are almost impossible to crack, and are little understood. They're hard to track down, and there's little payoff to be found in doing so. The God-Machine could easily construct one (or even piggyback on an existing structure), using it to contact undercover agents or predict occult events. One could even stand as a piece of Command &amp; Control Infrastructure, carefully hidden in the wilderness and obscured by other Infrastructure and mortal technology.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T09:39:49-08:00","id":42941,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_National_Radio_Quiet_Zone\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United...dio_Quiet_Zone</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wikipedia</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The <b>United States National Radio Quiet Zone</b> is a large area of land centered between the National Radio Astronomy Observatory at Green Bank, West Virginia and the Sugar Grove Research Facility at Sugar Grove, West Virginia. The Radio Quiet Zone is a rectangle of land approximately 13,000 square miles (34,000 km<sup>2</sup>) in size that straddles the border area of Virginia and West Virginia. It includes all land with latitudes between 37\u00b0 30\u2032 0.4\u2033 N and 39\u00b0 15\u2032 0.4\u2033 N and longitudes between 78\u00b0 29\u2032 59.0\u2033 W and 80\u00b0 29\u2032 59.2\u2033 W.<br /> <br /> The National Radio Quiet Zone protects the telescopes of the NRAO facility and the antennas and receivers of the U.S. Navy Information Operations Command (NIOC) at Sugar Grove, West Virginia. The NIOC at Sugar Grove has long been the location of electronic intelligence-gathering systems, and is today said to be a key station in the ECHELON system operated by the National Security Agency (NSA).<br /> <br /> The Quiet Zone was created by the Federal Communications Commission (FCC) in 1958 to protect the radio telescopes at Green Bank and Sugar Grove from harmful interference. Restrictions on transmission are tightest within ten miles of these sites, where most omnidirectional and high-power transmissions are prohibited.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}